      excerpt: "The nonrefundable portion in excess of the \xA7 26(a) limitation carries to the succeeding taxable year \u2014 'No credit may be carried forward under this subsection to any taxable year following the fifth taxable year after the taxable year in which the credit arose.' The refundable \xA7 23(a)(4) portion never carries. [This target reports the carryforward generated this year; prior-year carryforwards are not tracked.]"
